{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id85208769"}, "name":{"label":"Grouchal"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-09-03T05:01:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.6"}, "id":{"label":"864733701"}, "title":{"label":"Sync is a joke and developer doesn't care"}, "content":{"label":"Great looking app and if you live in a world where you only have one device then it is perfect.\n\nI don't live in that world and after spending a lot of time trying to get things to work it is clear that the current app can't support downloading changes made on other devices automatically.\n\niCloud complains of error 260 and Dropbox works well to sync when the app is running.\n\nThe app needs either server notifications based on the data in Dropbox or to hack background running like the Dropbox and instapaper apps do.\n\nComplete waste of time and money so far.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
