{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id63851"}, "name":{"label":"ELastic_Refrigerator"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-04-06T15:23:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.4"}, "id":{"label":"783254013"}, "title":{"label":"Actually I don't like it"}, "content":{"label":"Pros\nQuick to add reminders and offset them for an hour or day etc.\nPretty\nTimer section is good\n\nCons\nJust keeps reminding you every minute till you action the reminder. Changed it to remind me every hour but it continued every minute. \nLimited because you cannot add notes\nJust one big list or reminders\n\nIts not that great in my eyes. It is quicker to add a reminder than most apps however. \n\nLoved the previous review about setting a reminder to make a cuppa?? Do people need a reminder about that? Generally you get thirsty which is a body reminder.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
