{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id19754290"}, "name":{"label":"thx1637"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-03-27T00:43:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.4"}, "id":{"label":"776780761"}, "title":{"label":"Have had this for a couple of months..."}, "content":{"label":"...now and this is a brilliant app!\n\nAs a person who has spent a considerable amount of pence on reminder apps before the Apple one came along, THIS app does all that I need to remember things and a little more. \n\nOnly a few seconds to remind you of things that pop in the head. It has saved me money with not missing bills to pay so it was well spent.\n\nTHIS is my first 5 star rating and it has warranted a place on my main Home app page. Isn't that praise enough?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
