{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id115675842"}, "name":{"label":"Chippy T"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-02-08T02:24:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.4"}, "id":{"label":"746784337"}, "title":{"label":"This one is the best..."}, "content":{"label":"I've tried a good few task managers over the last months, but Due is just about the best. It's got great functionality, it's elegant and it syncs between my iPhone, iPad and Mac beautifully. Don't be tempted by the freebies, just buy this brilliant app and you won't be disappointed. Five stars without a doubt.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id31288372"}, "name":{"label":"Stefan Elf"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-01-29T07:36:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.4"}, "id":{"label":"739418831"}, "title":{"label":"Great for people like me"}, "content":{"label":"The persistent \"auto snooze\" functionality of this app is just perfect for chronic postponers like myself... Out of sight, out of mind ... No more! This is the only reminder app that has actually worked for me - even though it's a bit annoying with its recurring alarms you soon start to appreciate getting things done at last.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id13517979"}, "name":{"label":"DoctorDee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-01-02T03:31:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.9.4"}, "id":{"label":"721102443"}, "title":{"label":"Had to uninstall it!"}, "content":{"label":"Bought this for iPhone and iPad. And synced between the two. But I ended up getting an avalanche of notifications about overdue and repeat events on my iPad - it ran the battery down. Didn't have the same issue (with exactly the same events in my list) on my iPhone.\n\nUninstalled Due and went back to using the new (and much improved) version of Wunderlist. And that app is Free!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
